  "transcript": [
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Good day! I've loaded incident IC-2001 for Uniformes Delta. Tell me calmly what happened, with times and everything, and I'll log each thing as you say it. ",
      "t_start_ms": 1459,
      "t_end_ms": 10907
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Alright, I'm wrapped up at Uniformes Delta, heading out.",
      "t_start_ms": 12302,
      "t_end_ms": 15910
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 15910,
      "t_end_ms": 16402
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "It was the online store going down this morning. Log the incident report for me before I forget it all.",
      "t_start_ms": 16402,
      "t_end_ms": 21907
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Well, monitoring flagged at around 5:40 in the morning that the site wasn't responding.",
      "t_start_ms": 35707,
      "t_end_ms": 40207
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 40207,
      "t_end_ms": 40704
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "When I got there, the web server was up but stuck, with the disk nearly full. I cleaned out the old logs, tuned the memory, and it came back.",
      "t_start_ms": 40704,
      "t_end_ms": 48707
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 51373,
      "t_end_ms": 52219
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 52322,
      "t_end_ms": 52323
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 52588,
      "t_end_ms": 52610
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "The outage was flagged by monitoring at 5:40. That's the first one.",
      "t_start_ms": 52610,
      "t_end_ms": 57108
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "At five forty, monitoring flagged the site wasn't responding, correct?Also, you mentioned the web server was stuck. Did you mean the Online store web server production or the Web server for testing staging? ",
      "t_start_ms": 62212,
      "t_end_ms": 63505
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "That's it.",
      "t_start_ms": 63505,
      "t_end_ms": 63910
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 64355,
      "t_end_ms": 64405
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "I got",
      "t_start_ms": 64405,
      "t_end_ms": 64706
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 64706,
      "t_end_ms": 65123
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "I got to the server room at 7:30. Well, the one that went down was the production web server.",
      "t_start_ms": 65705,
      "t_end_ms": 69410
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 69413,
      "t_end_ms": 69906
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "And the staging one never even noticed. It stayed up all night.",
      "t_start_ms": 69906,
      "t_end_ms": 73007
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Production.",
      "t_start_ms": 78906,
      "t_end_ms": 79307
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 79309,
      "t_end_ms": 79807
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "The production one is the one that went down. Staging stayed up. That's why I say it never even noticed.",
      "t_start_ms": 79807,
      "t_end_ms": 85411
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "That's it. Production.",
      "t_start_ms": 90707,
      "t_end_ms": 92008
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 92010,
      "t_end_ms": 92508
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "And the Payments API also queued up because payments weren't going through even when the site came back up. I already tested it with a trial purchase and it's fine.",
      "t_start_ms": 92508,
      "t_end_ms": 101011
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 105114,
      "t_end_ms": 105651
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 105802,
      "t_end_ms": 106108
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Yes, that one.",
      "t_start_ms": 106108,
      "t_end_ms": 107308
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 107318,
      "t_end_ms": 107711
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "The payments one.",
      "t_start_ms": 107711,
      "t_end_ms": 110092
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Put down medium, I guess, since it's working again in the end.",
      "t_start_ms": 122708,
      "t_end_ms": 126410
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 126411,
      "t_end_ms": 129653
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Noting  medium  severity,  correct? ",
      "t_start_ms": 129805,
      "t_end_ms": 131611
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "I, not medium.",
      "t_start_ms": 132006,
      "t_end_ms": 132612
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 132614,
      "t_end_ms": 133109
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "3 hours down during sales hours, that's high.",
      "t_start_ms": 133109,
      "t_end_ms": 135514
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "note down 2 follow-ups.",
      "t_start_ms": 136008,
      "t_end_ms": 137413
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Ask the provider for more disk on the web server and have monitoring alert by SMS, not just email.",
      "t_start_ms": 137808,
      "t_end_ms": 142920
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Noting  high  severity,  correct?  And  I've  logged  the  two  follow-ups: asking the provider for more disk on the web server and setting up SMS alerts for monitoring instead of just email. Is that everything or do you want to send the report? ",
      "t_start_ms": 144847,
      "t_end_ms": 147413
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "That's how it should be. Send it.",
      "t_start_ms": 147912,
      "t_end_ms": 149021
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 149021,
      "t_end_ms": 150445
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 150597,
      "t_end_ms": 151086
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Report  sent!  Everything  is  logged  and  the  incident  report  is  on  its  way.  Have  a  safe  drive! ",
      "t_start_ms": 151239,
      "t_end_ms": 157445
    }
